      middle grey), white by the sensor's green clip, black below half a code. Scene -> white-balanced camera RGB clipped at the
      sensor ceilings -> lattice -> linear ProPhoto -> Bradford -> the display, out-of-gamut colours clipped
      ("(gamut compressed)" displays compress them). Used on the sRGB and Rec.1886 displays.
